ing_p03.py --output-dir data/accounting-master/deliverables/P03. Require actual observations, complete deliverables and nonzero exit on any failed or missing obligation.', 'Compare independently authored typed and textual programs through complete semantic and binding projections. Verify comments, LF/CRLF and permitted spelling changes preserve semantics while retaining distinct provenance; renamed declarations and changed valid economic inputs must compile without fixture lookup.', 'Independentl\ndata/accounting-master/runs/20261002T205123-6b8e9a16/P03/review_plan-0.response.json\n{\"verdict\": \"AGREE\", \"issues\": [], \"residuals\": [\"P03 implementation, tests and declared deliverables are still absent; the prior attempt timed out without completion evidence.\", \"General-language support, arbitrary mappings, cross-company concepts and broader uncertainty remain open under G2, G12 and G15.\", \"The phase will establish bounded deterministic engineering conformance only; it cannot establish full accounting validity, empirical forecast validity, authoring superiority or human acceptance.\"], \"checks\": [\"Audited the plan for wrong baselines, proxy promotion, stop conditions, comparison fairness, hidden defaults, stale timeout context, environment mismatch and artifact sufficiency.\", \"Confirmed the plan requires independent textual and typed entrypoints, changed-input sensitivity, renamed source variants, schema-valid semantic negatives and explicit unsupported coverage.\", \"Confirmed the plan explicitly repairs the observed silent report-field loss and semantic-projection mismatch.\", \"Verified the declared dependency versions and inspected the current profile, frontend, IR module, grammar, schema, fixtures and prior process records.\", \"No implementation or deliverable files were changed during this review.\"]}\ndata/accounting-master/runs/20261002T181809-4cb566e0/P03/phase-entry-inventory.json\n{'scripts/build_repair_fixtures.py': 'd547424c6bb898adf919a4